@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "收费人员" as A0
boundary "<u>:收费人员接口</u>" as B0
actor "诊所负责人" as A1
boundary "<u>:诊所负责人接口</u>" as B1
control "<u>:维护收费价目控</u>\n<u>制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:收费项目</u>" as Service
participant "<u>:价目</u>" as Price
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-05办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-05办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Service : 提出新价目(金额、区间、原因)
activate Service
Service -> Price : 核对区间及金额(已有适用区间)
activate Price
Price --> Service : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Price
Service -> Price : 提交确认(已核对价目草稿)
activate Price
Price --> Service : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Price
Service --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Service
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
A1 -> B1 : 核对草稿并确认发布
activate B1
B1 -> B1 : 检查输入格式()
B1 -> K : 协调UC-05办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
K -> Service : 确认价目发布(负责人意见)
activate Service
Service -> Price : 发布确认版本(确认人、确认时间)
activate Price
Price --> Service : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Price
Service --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Service
end
K --> B1 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B1 --> A1 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B1
note over K,Price
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
